# The Carla test rig's saved project.
#
# Machine-specific: it hardcodes an absolute plugin path, one particular
# soundcard and one particular MIDI keyboard by name. Carla also rewrites it on
# every save, dumping the synth's full parameter set, so it churns constantly.
#
# dev/carla.sh generates it from the template when it is missing.
dev/fortyfifth-test.carxp
